      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "According to [Partnership Branding](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cs0f8owO7hJM4vfOhWBOvAoOB1Sp8k_e) folder on Google Drive, `VRChat_PR_Description_Partnership.txt` was last updated on 17 July 2020. (But the logos in that folder were updated in 2024.)",
